sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (SDK/MCP/Git)
    participant A as API Server
    participant S3 as Object Storage
    participant R as Redis
    participant W as Worker
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant WH as Webhooks

    C->>A: POST /capture/passive (or /git)
    A->>A: Validate JWT + rate limit
    A->>S3: PUT raw payload
    A->>PG: INSERT session (status=processing)
    A->>R: LPUSH synapse:session
    A-->>C: 202 {sessionId}

    R->>W: BRPOP synapse:session
    W->>S3: GET raw payload
    W->>W: Segment into chunks
    W->>PG: INSERT chunks
    W->>W: Embed (768d via Ollama)
    W->>PG: UPDATE chunk embeddings
    W->>W: Extract facts (heuristic)
    W->>PG: INSERT facts + embeddings
    W->>W: Detect contradictions (cosine >0.85)
    W->>PG: UPDATE superseded facts
    W->>W: Cross-session dedup (cosine >0.95)
    W->>PG: Archive duplicates
    W->>W: Populate knowledge graph
    W->>PG: UPSERT graph_nodes + graph_edges
    W->>PG: INSERT search_index_entries
    W->>PG: UPDATE session (status=searchable)
    W-->>WH: Emit session.captured + fact.created events

    Note over W,LLM: Periodic (every 6h)
    W->>PG: Find old sessions (>14 days)
    W->>LLM: Summarize chunks
    W->>PG: INSERT summary chunk + archive originals
